		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おや？　ポケモンは
なにかを　くわえている▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-04T11:39:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
